Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.75,0:00:03.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙紀元72年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.62,0:00:08.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,地球 PLANT之間歷時一年半的戰爭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:13.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,終於在雅金 多維區域的戰鬥中帶來了終結
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.82,0:00:16.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,經過雙方同意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.19,0:00:21.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在過去的悲劇發生地Junius 7上締結的條約
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:25.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,成為雙方今後相互理解,努力追求和平的誓言
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.07,0:00:30.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,世界再次開始走向安定...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.37,0:00:36.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但過強的力量又會招來爭端
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.15,0:00:38.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不　公主
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.29,0:00:43.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為爭端無法消除所以才需要力量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.55,0:00:51.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Junius 7又加速2%
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.60,0:00:55.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,依然是撞向地球的軌道 005
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:00:59.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為何還不醒悟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:01.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對我們協調者來說
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.77,0:01:06.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,巴特利葛 薩拉所走的道路才是唯一的正途
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.69,0:01:15.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,然而
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.84,0:01:21.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,由於後稱「Break The World」的 Junius 7墜落事件
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.75,0:01:26.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,世界再次走向混亂的戰爭狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.42,0:01:31.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為阻止其墜落而一同降落地球的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.62,0:01:33.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ZAFT最新銳艦Minerva
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.50,0:01:38.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,依據在卡潘塔利亞所接收的新命令
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.53,0:01:40.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為支援蘇伊士攻略戰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.07,0:01:43.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,前往波斯灣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.24,0:01:47.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發令紅色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.19,0:01:49.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發令紅色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.88,0:01:51.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,駕駛員到搭乘機待機
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:01:58.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只會靠數量纏人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.95,0:02:06.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,撤退　撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.26,0:02:20.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想打的話倒也無妨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.59,0:02:23.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我沒做錯事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.94,0:02:26.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那裡的人也因此得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.42,0:02:30.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戰爭不是英雄遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.93,0:02:33.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不許獨斷專行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:37.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,擁有能力的人更應該自覺
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,儚く散った光が
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らを今呼び覚ます
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しみは音を立て
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,消えるあの場所から
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,深く愛する
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,勇氣と希望強く
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,感じるこの記憶が
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絡み合う心と
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ココロをつないで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,動き出している
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,輝く光が照らし
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らを今呼び起こす
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,響きあう音を立て
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,刻むこの場所から
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,永久に信じ続けて…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PHASE-17　戰士的條件
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.61,0:04:28.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,由此影像可知　死傷者已超過千人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.79,0:04:30.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,赤道聯合政府已…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.56,0:04:33.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,18日　大西洋聯邦總統發言
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.98,0:04:37.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,昨日　南非共同體的賈多亞議長…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.61,0:04:38.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,針對此聲明…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.82,0:04:43.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,每天每天　都是些讓人鬱悶的新聞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.37,0:04:50.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就沒有些讓人感覺更開朗的消息嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.74,0:04:55.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,「水族館的白海豚產下了寶寶」這類嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.67,0:04:57.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒那麼誇張
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.00,0:05:00.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過　感覺有點奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.77,0:05:03.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和PLANT的戰鬥怎樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.39,0:05:07.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,收到的都是聯合的混亂情況
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.71,0:05:14.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PLANT還是PLANT　一直是這狀況
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.42,0:06:07.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,勇敢的ZAFT官兵們
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.56,0:06:11.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了和平　我們也會加油
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.26,0:06:14.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家也要小心呀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.76,0:06:20.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家看來都很有精神很開心呀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.02,0:06:23.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣也沒關係嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.94,0:06:25.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就這麼置之不理
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.43,0:06:29.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能做的話　倒是想做點什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.31,0:06:34.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但魯莽行事只是暴露行蹤而已
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.34,0:06:38.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且目前看來不太合適吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.41,0:06:41.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對收留我們藏身的斯堪迪納維亞王國也是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.56,0:06:43.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯　說的是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.57,0:06:49.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但也不可能一直這麼藏下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.50,0:06:52.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也很擔心奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.75,0:06:54.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是　現在仍無法行動
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.80,0:06:57.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,仍然一無所知
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.80,0:06:59.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.92,0:07:06.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Junius 7的墜落確實給地球帶來了巨大的損害
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.74,0:07:09.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,其後PLANT的姿態很紳士
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.17,0:07:13.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,急著開戰的聯合軍才是傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.87,0:07:14.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.63,0:07:17.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是Blue Cosmos吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.58,0:07:18.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.37,0:07:24.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過狄蘭達爾議長在那難以置信的第一波攻擊之後
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.13,0:07:26.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,仍然應對自如
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.84,0:07:28.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,安撫市民和議會
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.21,0:07:31.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只展開最低限度的防衛戰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.52,0:07:34.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼看都不是壞人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.69,0:07:37.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,目前看來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.07,0:07:40.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,實際上也是不錯的領導人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.00,0:07:42.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,狄蘭達爾議長
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.45,0:07:46.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,或者說　我曾經這麼想
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.55,0:07:51.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在得知暗殺拉克絲和這件事之前
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.16,0:07:56.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭也是這麼想　才說要去PLANT的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.98,0:07:59.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是誰打算殺害拉克絲？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.95,0:08:03.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還有這件事　使我無法相信
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.15,0:08:06.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個叫狄蘭達爾的人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.51,0:08:08.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.93,0:08:10.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他在欺騙大眾
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.28,0:08:14.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說是政治或許能說得通
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.64,0:08:19.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他又不可能對此一無所知
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.36,0:08:26.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在想什麼呢　議長
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.49,0:08:31.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看到歐亞大陸西部的狀況
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.10,0:08:36.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我總不禁想和ZAFT聯手　攻打地球軍
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.16,0:08:41.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你還是反對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.45,0:08:43.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.02,0:08:48.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭要是回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.78,0:08:52.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,或許能知道些PLANT的事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.47,0:08:58.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底在幹什麼呢　那傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.29,0:09:20.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已捕獲邁赫穆爾基地的導航信號
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.03,0:09:23.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,固定信號　準備入港
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.77,0:09:26.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,固定信號　開始準備入港
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.45,0:09:39.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,通告CPU系統維修B組
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.72,0:09:43.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Zaku的炮管冷卻系統更換工作改為15時
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.80,0:09:45.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,按要求改變了傳感器的搜索範圍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.60,0:09:47.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你確認一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.61,0:09:50.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,薩拉隊長
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.16,0:09:53.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過真羨慕軍本部的人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.49,0:09:57.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲 克萊茵的演唱會可是好久沒開過了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.87,0:09:59.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也好想看現場表演
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.89,0:10:03.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是　她風格改變了不少啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.83,0:10:04.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！是！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.41,0:10:09.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得和以前相比現在這樣也不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.60,0:10:12.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,感覺好像更年輕了　最近更可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.39,0:10:15.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且這次的衣裝不覺得更大膽了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.41,0:10:18.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊是啊　還有胸部
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.76,0:10:20.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還真大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.26,0:10:24.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這件衣服的海報，我真是想要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.25,0:10:26.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Saviour的整備記錄呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.21,0:10:29.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,呃　在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.67,0:10:31.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,謝了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:39.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是他未婚妻吧　真羨慕
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.56,0:10:43.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要把Saviour的電纜拔他兩三根啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.97,0:10:45.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我聽到了　你們兩個
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.73,0:10:48.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,包括剛才的全部
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.98,0:10:50.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.29,0:11:03.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,導航程式啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.94,0:11:06.84,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1060,668)\fad(200,300)}ZAFT軍 邁赫穆爾基地
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.65,0:11:05.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,連接5號主機
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.94,0:11:08.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,LHM-BB01　Minerva
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.29,0:11:09.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,保持原狀接近
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.10,0:11:11.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,BB01控制中心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.01,0:11:12.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.77,0:11:18.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,入港完成
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.09,0:11:20.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,各人員迅速檢查
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.89,0:11:22.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開始檢查工作
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.62,0:11:24.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以後另有命令之前於艦內待機
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.36,0:11:26.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,薩拉隊長請到艦橋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.25,0:11:34.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別老是瞪著人家　有話想說就說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.17,0:11:37.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,太孩子氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.62,0:11:52.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva艦長　塔利雅 庫拉提斯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.78,0:11:54.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,副艦長　阿瑟 特萊茵
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.43,0:11:57.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,特務部隊　阿斯蘭 薩拉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.38,0:12:00.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 薩拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.60,0:12:02.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.95,0:12:03.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs35}就是克魯澤隊那個？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.44,0:12:07.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,失禮了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.58,0:12:11.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是邁赫穆爾基地司令官　約阿希姆 拉德爾
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.64,0:12:14.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一路辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.12,0:12:15.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.36,0:12:18.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,先來杯咖啡怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.47,0:12:22.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,地方雖然寒酸　但咖啡豆一流
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.83,0:12:24.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯　非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.60,0:12:29.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這　我也不是不明白真的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.43,0:12:33.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,突然跑回來　說是FAITH啊長官什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.56,0:12:34.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也真是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.33,0:12:37.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還被打了兩下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.67,0:12:43.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但FAITH就是FAITH
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:47.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法啊　人家又不是沒那個實力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.58,0:12:48.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.49,0:12:51.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜你真囉嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.65,0:12:53.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你哪裡像是明白了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.27,0:12:55.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好了你閉嘴啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.73,0:12:58.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和露娜沒關係吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.89,0:13:03.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.57,0:13:25.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我方情況看起來比較嚴峻呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.61,0:13:30.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯　以蘇伊士的兵力的確不敢輕舉妄動
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.10,0:13:35.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,非要攻陷的話　只有像上次大戰時那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.83,0:13:39.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,從軌道上發動大規模空降的作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:44.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不知為何議會未能通過這個方案
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.13,0:13:47.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,「我方沒有領土侵略野心」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.25,0:13:51.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,既然說了這種話，當然是不能了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.40,0:14:00.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖說我也支持當前議會 和議長不輕易擴大戰火的方針
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.40,0:14:07.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但太過低調難免讓敵人變本加厲
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.89,0:14:11.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼說　發生什麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.25,0:14:12.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在蘇伊士以外
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.15,0:14:16.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,地球軍原本打算以蘇伊士為據點
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.25,0:14:23.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一口氣攻佔邁赫穆爾、地中海口 和我們的直布羅陀基地
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.16,0:14:27.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但現在卻無法如願
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.96,0:14:31.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為何？理由在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.68,0:14:33.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,歐亞西部地區嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.10,0:14:39.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現今印度洋和直布羅陀幾乎歸屬我方勢力範圍
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.04,0:14:45.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以地球軍必須絕對保證這塊大陸到蘇伊士的穩定
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.91,0:14:48.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不然蘇伊士會被孤立
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.60,0:14:52.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他們在山谷內
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.27,0:14:54.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以加魯納漢的火力發電廠為中心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.24,0:15:00.34,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(646,628)\fad(200,300)\fs30}地球連合軍占領地區 加魯納漢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.73,0:14:57.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,強行設立一門炮台
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.80,0:15:00.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,同時對歐亞抵抗運動構成威脅
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.28,0:15:04.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,勉強支持著蘇伊士的防線
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.47,0:15:08.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因此　這裡附近的抵抗軍
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.76,0:15:13.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,暴露在歐亞中央部隊的攻擊下　卻無法南下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.51,0:15:16.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,情況日趨慘烈
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.53,0:15:19.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但反過來說
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.25,0:15:23.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只要攻陷這裡　就能切斷蘇伊士防線
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.01,0:15:26.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還可以支援抵抗軍
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.77,0:15:30.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,間接對地球軍造成打擊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.18,0:15:32.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.59,0:15:35.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嘛　沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.65,0:15:37.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但對方也明白這個道理
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.70,0:15:42.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不會讓我們輕易得手
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.88,0:15:45.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能從這裡接近的只有這條溪谷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.73,0:15:49.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當然對方也知道這些
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.91,0:15:51.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在這裡設置陽電子炮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.26,0:15:57.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還在周圍配備了裝有陽電子反射器的怪物MA
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.20,0:16:00.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,之前也曾嘗試突破
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.57,0:16:02.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,結果慘不忍睹
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.64,0:16:26.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和那時候一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.76,0:16:37.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但加上Minerva的戰鬥力　或許…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.85,0:16:39.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.70,0:16:47.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不突破那裡我們也無法順利去直布羅陀　是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.60,0:16:52.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嘛　就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.32,0:17:01.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,派我們來這裡開路　到底是哪個老狐狸的主意呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.49,0:17:06.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,算了　再怎麼說也是工作
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.73,0:17:14.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 詳細作戰計劃稍後再議
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.89,0:17:17.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也必須準備
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.85,0:17:22.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次一定要和Minerva一起打開通路
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.64,0:17:44.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那真到現在都不和薩拉隊長說話？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.27,0:17:48.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊　拿他沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.11,0:17:51.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真還真是個小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.43,0:17:52.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.88,0:17:56.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也許不該說　我看到他也這麼想
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.89,0:17:59.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,應該遲早會和好的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.73,0:18:01.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,反正肯定是真輸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.79,0:18:06.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊　薩拉隊長成熟多了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.74,0:18:13.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過他和我應該只差一歲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.05,0:18:27.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了　一個人在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.79,0:18:30.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.08,0:18:36.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你才是呢 這樣好嗎 FAITH不是很忙嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.98,0:18:39.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在這裡閒逛是否合適呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.57,0:18:45.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是個只會頂撞人的傢伙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.60,0:18:48.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼不爽嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.62,0:18:53.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來的事、打你的事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.43,0:18:55.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼大不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.41,0:19:00.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過沒人被打後還會開心　理所當然吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.00,0:19:06.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說來　之前還在奧布為阿斯哈做護衛的人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.05,0:19:10.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,突然回來　又是FAITH　又是長官
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.93,0:19:14.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能那麼簡單接受嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.34,0:19:19.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你這不是胡來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.66,0:19:26.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也許吧　我承認
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.80,0:19:33.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,的確在你看來　我做的事不可理喻
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.14,0:19:36.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就因為這些？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.23,0:19:42.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就因為這些不聽我的話　看不順眼？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.19,0:19:46.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只有自己是對的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.09,0:19:52.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自己看不順眼  不承認的東西都是錯的 你想這麼說嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.70,0:19:54.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.47,0:19:58.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那印度洋的戰鬥呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.78,0:20:02.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在仍然認為那樣沒錯嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.68,0:20:11.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.69,0:20:18.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以前你說在奧布的初島上失去了家人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.84,0:20:20.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是說被殺
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.82,0:20:22.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被阿斯哈
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.59,0:20:25.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯　非要這麼想倒也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.08,0:20:31.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是　所以你就為此而有了這種想法嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.85,0:20:34.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那時候只要有力量…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.10,0:20:37.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只要得到力量…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.45,0:20:41.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.55,0:20:48.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,曾為自己的無力哭泣過的人　誰都會這麼想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.68,0:20:50.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大概...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.48,0:21:04.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但獲得這份力量之時開始
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.83,0:21:08.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你自己就會成為悲劇的製造者
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.45,0:21:11.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這點絕對別忘記
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.69,0:21:16.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們遲早又會踏上戰場
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.74,0:21:18.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那時如果忘記這點
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.20,0:21:21.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,靠自做主張的藉口和正義
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.32,0:21:23.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,單純揮舞這份力量
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.19,0:21:26.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣就只是個破壞者
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.22,0:21:33.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是那樣的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.48,0:21:38.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是為軍隊的任務出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.56,0:21:40.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是去打架
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.34,0:21:43.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種事我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.45,0:21:47.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就可以　只要別忘記它
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.21,0:21:50.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你的確是個優秀的駕駛員
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.61,0:21:55.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不然就只是個笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,涙で滲んだ  この時空を  見上げるたび
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,儚い蒼さが  胸を締めつけてく
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,運命なら  哀しみの果てまで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戦い続けた  日々を跡に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Life Goes On　燃え上がる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,命がある限り
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真実の自分さえ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,見失いそう　それでも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Life Goes On　守りたくて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,心は砕かれて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本当の哀しみを知った瞳は
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,愛に溢れて....
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.28,0:23:25.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,擋住去路的Lohengrin之門
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.05,0:23:28.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以及敵人MA
